# Return in Soma chat starts a new line and does not send (Boss, 2026-10-25: "the return button on the keyboard …
# go to the next line in the text and not send"). The fictional chat fixture runs production OmaChatScreen; no real
# sends. Prerequisite: -PartifactPreview :artifact-preview:assembleDebug installed on this emulator.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
launch dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity
tap ask soma
type first line
key ENTER
type second line
wait 600
# Both lines are still in the field, one under the other: Return broke the line instead of sending.
expect first line
expect second line
shot return-new-line
key BACK
[phone] In Soma chat with the Soma keyboard, type a line, press return, type another: two lines in the field, nothing sent until the send arrow.
